{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119350","id":3652355666,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7ZsoZS","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119350","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119350.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119350.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119350","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119350/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119350/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119350/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6a330e367bb5f24bbf2d77ce262ed7b663a8228c","number":119350,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add unit tests for `LinkButton`","user":{"login":"calbebop","id":70987281,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTg3Mjgx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70987281?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop","html_url":"https://github.com/calbebop","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Contributes to #43440\r\n\r\nAdds unit tests for `LinkButton` covering:\r\n\r\n* Defaults: empty text and URI, `UNDERLINE_MODE_ALWAYS`, `TEXT_DIRECTION_AUTO`, empty language, `OVERRUN_NO_TRIMMING`, default structured-text BiDi parser and empty options, plus constructor overrides for `FOCUS_ACCESSIBILITY` and `CURSOR_POINTING_HAND`\r\n* `LinkButton(text)` constructor argument\r\n* Text and URI round-trips with idempotent re-set (early-return path) and empty-string clear\r\n* All three `UnderlineMode` enum values plus same-value no-op\r\n* All four valid `TextDirection` values plus out-of-range rejection guard (`ERR_PRINT_OFF`-wrapped)\r\n* Language round-trip and clear\r\n* Ellipsis char round-trip and multi-character clamping to the first character (`WARN_PRINT` suppressed via `ERR_PRINT_OFF`)\r\n* Structured-text BiDi override parser and options round-trips, including same-parser no-op and reset to defaults\r\n* Overrun behavior interaction with `get_combined_minimum_size()`: `OVERRUN_TRIM_CHAR` and `OVERRUN_TRIM_WORD` force width to zero, and restoring `OVERRUN_NO_TRIMMING` removes the override (reversibility)\r\n* `get_cursor_shape()` returns `CURSOR_POINTING_HAND` when enabled and `CURSOR_ARROW` when disabled\r\n\r\nThe minimum-size case asserts only the font-independent branch of `LinkButton::get_minimum_size()` (the unconditional `width = 0` override under overrun trimming) so the test passes on stripped builds with no default font, including the Linux Minimal template CI job.\r\n\r\nFork CI: workflow tests completed successfully on [`calbebop/godot`](https://github.com/calbebop/godot) for branch `add-link-button-unit-tests`.\r\n\r\nAI disclosure: I designed the test plan, wrote and reviewed the changes, and validated style and behavior against `LinkButton` in-tree. Cursor helped with research and drafting.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2231